{
  "slug": "mercadopago",
  "name": "Mercadopago",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Mercado Pago full-product integration toolkit. One agent routes to four orchestration skills (mp-integrate wizard, mp-webhooks, mp-test-setup, mp-review) that pull every endpoint, payload, and snippet live from the official Mercado Pago MCP server. The MCP must always be connected — there is no offline mode.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `mp-integrate` (Wizard that scaffolds a complete Mercado Pago integration from official and bundled sources, using MCP only for selected…), `mp-review` (Review a Mercado Pago integration with a local cross-cutting security checklist and official MCP quality tools on demand), `mp-test-setup` (Create test users and add funds to them for Mercado Pago testing), `mp-webhooks` (Configure and validate Mercado Pago webhooks)\n- **Agents** (1): `mp-integration-expert` (Use when implementing, reviewing, or debugging any Mercado Pago payment integration)\n- **Commands** (4): `mp-connect` (Verify or manually trigger Mercado Pago MCP authentication), `mp-integrate` (Scaffold a Mercado Pago integration via the mp-integrate wizard), `mp-review` (Review a Mercado Pago integration with a local security checklist and, when requested, the official quality checklist from…), `mp-test-cards` (Returns test card numbers for a given country)\n- **Hooks** (2): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mercadopago@claude-plugins-official` from `mercadopago/mercadopago-claude-marketplace` (`plugins/mercadopago`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
